      "content": "a path to safety? that sounds so intense. i'm looking around now... i also noticed the person behind the counter was wearing a bright yellow apron, and there's a massive display of red apples right in the middle of the aisle i'm in. how do the yellow and red fit into the sequence you just decoded? does that change the warning?",
